# Risk Engine

Never use static thresholds when behavioral intelligence is available.

Risk decisions should combine:

• Behavioral AI
• Context Intelligence
• FIN
• FRI/MNRL
• Device Trust
• Historical Behaviour
• Transaction Analysis

Every prediction must return:

• Risk Score
• Risk Category
• Confidence
• Triggered Factors
• AI Explanation
• Recommended Action

Never display generic messages such as:

"Transaction Blocked"

Instead explain WHY the decision was made.
